<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>US Tax Intake & Document Checklist | Individual & Business | US Tax Deals</title><meta name="description" content="Start your individual or business tax intake with US Tax Deals. Answer guided questions and get a personalized tax document checklist for your preparer."><link rel="canonical" href="{{ url('/tax-intake') }}"><meta property="og:title" content="A simpler start to your US tax return | US Tax Deals"><meta property="og:description" content="Individual and business tax intake with guided questions and a personalized document checklist."><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:url" content="{{ url('/tax-intake') }}"><meta name="theme-color" content="#0f1b2d"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/intake-assets/intake.css?v=20261015b"><script type="application/ld+json">{!! json_encode(['@context'=>'https://schema.org','@type'=>'WebPage','name'=>'US Tax Intake and Document Checklist','url'=>url('/tax-intake'),'description'=>'Guided individual and business tax intake with a personalized document checklist.','isPartOf'=>['@type'=>'WebSite','name'=>'US Tax Deals','url'=>url('/')]], JSON_HEX_TAG|JSON_HEX_AMP|JSON_HEX_APOS|JSON_HEX_QUOT|JSON_UNESCAPED_SLASHES) !!}</script></head><body><header><a href="/" class="brand">US TAX DEALS <span>Tax Concierge</span></a><nav aria-label="Main"><a href="/services">Services</a><a href="/contact">Contact</a><a href="/login">Sign in</a></nav></header><main><section class="intro"><span class="badge"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> GUIDED TAX INTAKE</span><h1>Your year.<br>Your taxes.<br>A clearer starting point.</h1><p>Preparing a US tax return starts with the right information. Tell us about your income, family or business, and get a personalized document checklist for your tax preparer.</p></section><section class="paths" aria-label="Choose a tax intake"><a class="path" href="/tax-intake/individual"><span class="intake-mark" aria-hidden="true">01</span><h2>Individual Tax Intake</h2><p>W-2 income, freelance work, dependents, education, investments and life changes.</p><b>Start individual intake →</b></a><a class="path" href="/tax-intake/business"><span class="intake-mark" aria-hidden="true">02</span><h2>Business Tax Intake</h2><p>Business entity, bookkeeping, payroll, contractor payments, assets and state activity.</p><b>Start business intake →</b></a></section><section class="guide-grid" aria-label="How tax intake works"><article><p class="eyebrow">01 / TELL YOUR STORY</p><h2>Questions that follow your answers</h2><p>Follow-up questions appear when they apply, so your preparer can understand your situation.</p></article><article><p class="eyebrow">02 / GET ORGANIZED</p><h2>A starting document checklist</h2><p>See which tax forms and supporting records your team may need, with a reason for each request.</p></article><article><p class="eyebrow">03 / LET US REVIEW</p><h2>A prepared tax team</h2><p>We review your answers, clarify missing details, and arrange secure document collection.</p></article></section><section><h2>Tax intake questions, answered</h2><details class="faq"><summary>Is the AI helper free?</summary><p>Yes. Enable free AI inside either questionnaire. It downloads a small model to your device and matches your questions to reviewed intake guidance. It does not generate new tax advice, calculate a refund, or determine eligibility. Your form works without loading the model.</p></details><details class="faq"><summary>Which intake should I use for freelance or gig work?</summary><p>Start with Individual Tax Intake if you are filing your personal return with freelance, gig or sole-proprietor income. Use Business Tax Intake for a separate business return or if you need help confirming how your entity is taxed.</p></details><details class="faq"><summary>Should I upload my tax documents here?</summary><p>No. This questionnaire does not accept document uploads, Social Security numbers, EINs or bank details. Your preparer will confirm a secure document-sharing process.</p></details><details class="faq"><summary>Does this calculate my tax refund?</summary><p>No. It organizes your answers and suggests documents and follow-up items. A preparer verifies eligibility, applicable tax-year rules and state requirements before preparing a return.</p></details><details class="faq"><summary>Can I use this if I am unsure about an answer?</summary><p>Yes. Choose Not sure when available. Your tax team will see that clarification is needed.</p></details></section><p class="muted">Explore our <a href="/individual-tax-fill">individual tax preparation services</a> and <a href="/business-tax-fill">business tax filing services</a>.</p></main><footer><p>US Tax Deals · Thoughtful preparation starts with the right questions.</p><p class="legal"><a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy policy</a><a href="/terms">Terms</a><a href="/contact">Contact our team</a></p></footer></body></html>
